    "title": "EU Hubs in Eastern Europe: Concerns and Speculations",
    "text": "• A recent story indicated that 'hubs' would be established in Eastern European countries.\n• These countries have been criticized by the EU for rejecting policies that require open borders.\n• There are concerns that the establishment of these hubs may lead to an influx of migrants into these countries.\n• Speculation exists that the EU may impose restrictions on these countries regarding the repatriation of migrants.",
